+# CORRECTION-001: Manifest filename typo and related changes
+
+Date recorded: 2026-10-20
+
+## Error
+The manifest file was named incorrectly. The repository owner reported a typo:
+the correct name is **Manifex.sha256**, not "manifest" / MANIFEST.sha256.
+
+## Where the wrong name appears (not edited)
+- RESULT.md, line 5: "(sha256 in MANIFEST.sha256)"
+- oob-fingerprint-reference.md, line 9: "git add MANIFEST.sha256 ..."
+
+These lines were NOT edited, because the result record and reference file are kept unchanged. Read them with this correction in mind.
+
+## Related changes in this commit
+- The raw GPG transcript is now stored as btp001-gpg-verify-raw-output.txt. It records a real GOODSIG check (signing key 827B5E62..., email evan.ketchum2000@gmail.com). A `gpg_exit=0` line is appended at the end, and the hash in Manifex.sha256 is computed over the final bytes including that line.
+- The key fingerprint file is now btp001-signing-key-fingerprint.txt. It lists the primary key (827B5E62...) and the encryption subkey (66DFF878...). The subkey line is new relative to the earlier key_fingerprint.txt on main.
+- The repo-head file is now btp001-repo-head-commit.txt. Its content is the signed commit 0cd5bc4.
+- btp001-input-sha256.txt is NOT included in this commit. The owner reverted an input_sha256.txt in dac3c96 as "added without authorization." That file's content was carried over under a new name in an earlier local draft, and that carry-over has been removed.
+
+## Files removed or deprecated in this commit
+- gpg_verify_raw_status.txt (removed). This was a placeholder ("reconstructed placeholder... replace with the true bytes") and hashed to 03a18c65.... The Manifex.sha256 entry on main for this name (2414fce0...) was a false digest. The real transcript is btp001-gpg-verify-raw-output.txt.
+- key_fingerprint.txt (removed). It duplicated btp001-signing-key-fingerprint.txt under the old name. The old file held the human-readable primary fingerprint (827B 5E62 05B5 8529 F1E2 FDCD FF81 7AEE AC19 C76A). The new file has the same primary key in GPG colon format, plus the encryption subkey. The human-readable form is no longer stored as a file, but the value is identical.
+- repo_head.txt (removed). It duplicated btp001-repo-head-commit.txt. Both have the same bytes (sha256 53d06b87...).
+- MANIFEST.sha256 (deprecated). It listed file names without hashes. It was replaced with a deprecation notice. Manifex.sha256 is the only manifest.
+
+After this commit, RESULT.md line 5 still names gpg_verify_raw_status.txt. CORRECTION-001 is the record of that rename and removal.
+
+## Attribution note
+The reverts dac3c96 and e6e804b on main are authored by evan ketchum. They were not made by the agent that prepared this commit.
+
+## Verification
+`sha256sum -c Manifex.sha256` returns OK for the three files listed.
